      <blockquote><p>“pairs hands-on outbound execution with unusually open, practical education”</p><footer>Global 100 judges’ comments · GPMG · 2027 edition</footer><a class="recognition-judges-source" href="/articles/global-100-award-2027/">Read the Global 100 judges’ feedback →</a></blockquote>
    </div>
    <div class="container-wide recognition-judges-details">{% for item in awardsHub.judging %}<article><h3>{{ item.title }}</h3><p>{{ item.text }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>

  <section class="recognition-results" id="campaign-results">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="recognition-section-heading"><div class="recognition-eyebrow">Campaign results</div><h2>See the work behind the recognition.</h2><p>Explore the targeting, conversations and outcomes from CallTeam’s published client campaigns.</p></div>
      <div class="recognition-result-grid recognition-result-grid--three">
        <article><div class="recognition-result-type">SaaS appointment setting</div><strong class="recognition-result-number">11</strong><h3>qualified demos in 90 days</h3><p>Four sales opportunities developed. Two customers signed within six months.</p><a class="recognition-text-link" href="/case-studies/saas-demo-appointment-setting/">Read the SaaS case study →</a></article>
        <article><div class="recognition-result-type">Manufacturing cybersecurity</div><strong class="recognition-result-number">9</strong><h3>qualified appointments in 90 days</h3><p>Three appointments progressed into sales opportunities with manufacturing buyers.</p><a class="recognition-text-link" href="/case-studies/manufacturing-cybersecurity-appointment-setting/">Read the cybersecurity case study →</a></article>
        <article><div class="recognition-result-type">HR software</div><strong class="recognition-result-number">9</strong><h3>booked product demos in 90 days</h3><p>Two proposals followed during the first 90 days. The campaign focused on workforce training, competency and qualification software.</p><a class="recognition-text-link" href="/case-studies/hr-software-lead-generation/">Read the HR software case study →</a></article>
      </div>
      <p class="recognition-result-note">Results are from separate client campaigns. The linked case studies explain the meeting definitions and reporting periods.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="recognition-services">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="recognition-section-heading"><div class="recognition-eyebrow">Put the expertise to work</div><h2>Your market. Our people.<br><span>A clear next conversation.</span></h2><p>CallTeam brings research, human calling, follow-up and qualification into one managed service.</p></div>
      <div class="recognition-service-grid">
        <article><span class="recognition-service-number">01</span><h3>B2B appointment setting</h3><p>Reach decision-makers, establish a relevant reason to meet and hand over the buyer context your sales team needs.</p><a class="recognition-text-link" href="/services/b2b-appointment-setting/">Explore appointment setting →</a></article>
        <article><span class="recognition-service-number">02</span><h3>B2B lead generation</h3><p>Prepare target accounts and prospect research so the outreach starts with a clear offer and a relevant buyer.</p><a class="recognition-text-link" href="/services/b2b-lead-generation/">Explore lead generation →</a></article>
        <article><span class="recognition-service-number">03</span><h3>Outsourced SDR services</h3><p>Put a managed team behind calling, follow-up and qualification, with agreed responsibilities and useful reporting.</p><a class="recognition-text-link" href="/services/outsourced-sdr/">Explore outsourced SDR services →</a></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="recognition-library">
    <div class="container-wide recognition-library-grid">
      <div><div class="recognition-eyebrow">Practical expertise, freely available</div><h2>Sales knowledge that helps before you become a client.</h2><p>Our free outbound sales library gives founders and sales teams practical help with whom to contact, what to say, how to handle objections and how to qualify a useful next step.</p><p>Use the resources yourself or bring CallTeam in to manage the execution.</p><a href="/resources/outbound-sales-library/" class="btn-primary">Explore the free sales library →</a></div>
      <div class="recognition-library-resources"><a href="/resources/cold-call-scripts/"><strong>100</strong><span>Free cold-call scripts <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a><a href="/resources/outbound-sales-library/"><strong>138</strong><span>Outbound sales guides <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a><a href="/b2b-outbound-campaign-planner/"><strong>Plan your campaign</strong><span>Interactive tools for practical preparation <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="recognition-questions" id="award-questions" aria-labelledby="award-questions-heading">
    <div class="container-wide"><div class="recognition-section-heading"><div class="recognition-eyebrow">CallTeam awards explained</div><h2 id="award-questions-heading">The awards, the issuers<br>and the work behind them.</h2></div><div class="recognition-faq">{% for item in awardsHub.faq %}<details><summary>{{ item.q }}</summary><p>{{ item.a }}</p>{% if item.links %}<div class="recognition-faq-links">{% for link in item.links %}<a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.label }} →</a>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}</details>{% endfor %}</div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="recognition-closing">
    <div class="container-wide"><div class="recognition-eyebrow">Multi-award-winning B2B outbound calling agency</div><h2>Put award-winning expertise<br>behind your next campaign.</h2><p>Tell us what you sell, who you need to reach and what a qualified meeting should look like.</p><a href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="body-51">Book a Free B2B Strategy Call</a><a class="recognition-about-link" href="/about/">Learn about CallTeam →</a></div>
  </section>
